==Description==
The '''Team Fury Nametag''' is a nametag that could have been obtained from Liutenant III rank of the [[PVP Season 0]].

The '''Team Fury Nametag''' has red and blue text broken by a white line in the middle. Behind the text, there is a blue and white background similarly split in half by a white thunderbolt.

==Update History==
*'''23 July 2025''' - [[v1.71.0]]
**'''Team Fury Nametag''' added.
**{{Bug}} Background flickers, with severity depending on the graphics setting level.
*'''22 October 2025''' - [[v1.77.0|v1.77.5a]]
**'''Team Fury Nametag''' is no longer obtainable. 



